</div> <div\nclass=\"js-block-header-descr t-section__descr t-descr t-descr_xl t-align_center t-margin_auto\" data-editable=\"true\"\nfield=\"bdescr\"> <p style=\"text-align: left;\">Через год у вас будет</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">один из двух сценариев:</p> </div> </div> </div> <style>.t-section__title,.t-section__descr {overflow-wrap:break-word;}.t-section__descr {max-width:560px;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:40px;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:90px;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:90px;}@media screen and (max-width:960px) {#rec2178787101 .t-section__title {margin-bottom:20px;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__descr {margin-bottom:45px;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__container:not(:has(.t-section__descr)) .t-section__title {margin-bottom:45px;}}</style> <style> #rec2178787101 .t-section__title{font-size:26px;color:#ffffff;}#rec2178787101 .t-section__descr{color:#ffffff;}</style> <div class=\"t-card__container t940__container t-container_100 \"> <div class=\"t940__row t940__row_indent-20px t-row\"> <div class=\"t940__features-wrap\"> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_half t940__item_indent-20px t-item\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__animation_slow \"> <style> @media screen and (min-width:480px){#rec2178787101 .t-card__title{font-size:30px;}}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__7792008718310\"> <div style=\"font-size: 26px;\" data-customstyle=\"yes\">Первый</div> </div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__7792008718310\">\nВы там же, где сейчас. Те же боли. <br />Те же напряжения. Те же поиски очередного “решения”. Ещё один потерянный год жизни в “разобранном” теле\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_slow\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(0,0,0,0.90));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_slow\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3132-6533-4835-b261-393465643431/4B4FC62C-39C4-41A1-B.PNG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__7792008718310\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3132-6533-4835-b261-393465643431/4B4FC62C-39C4-41A1-B.PNG'); background-color: #2258f6;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3132-6533-4835-b261-393465643431/4B4FC62C-39C4-41A1-B.PNG\"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"t940__item t940__item_half t940__item_indent-20px t-item\"> <div class=\"t940__card t940__card_boxed t-card__col t-card__col_withoutbtn \"> <div class=\"t940__content t940__animation_slow \"> <style> @media screen and (min-width:480px){#rec2178787101 .t-card__title{font-size:30px;}}</style> <div class=\"t-card__title t-name t-name_lg\" field=\"li_title__7792008718311\"> <div style=\"font-size: 26px;\" data-customstyle=\"yes\">Второй</div> </div> <div class=\"t-card__descr t-text t-text_sm\" field=\"li_descr__7792008718311\">\nВы прошли “Базовую настройку”. Собрали тело в систему. Двигаетесь по-другому. Чувствуете опору. Силу. Свободу. <br />И впервые за долгое время —благодарность к своему телу.\n</div> </div> <div\nclass=\"t940__overlay t940__animation_slow\"\nstyle=\"background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0), rgba(0,0,0,0.90));\"></div> <div class=\"t940__image t-bgimg t940__image_zoom t940__animation_slow\" data-original=\"/assets/tild3266-6130-4935-b365-363734353731/41597967-55B9-4C21-B.PNG\"\nbgimgfield=\"li_img__7792008718311\"\nstyle=\"background-image:url('/assets/tild3266-6130-4935-b365-363734353731/41597967-55B9-4C21-B.PNG'); background-color: #2258f6;\"\nitemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/ImageObject\"> <meta itemprop=\"image\" content=\"/assets/tild3266-6130-4935-b365-363734353731/41597967-55B9-4C21-B.PNG\"> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  </div>"}